and unlock the case.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:58.467
Can you imagine going in for
a dildo and pushing the button?

00:07:58.467 --> 00:07:59.601
[ Ding ]

00:07:59.601 --> 00:08:03.000
-Customer needs help
in the dildo aisle.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.234
-It's not for me.

00:08:04.234 --> 00:08:05.734
It's not for my wife, either.

00:08:05.734 --> 00:08:07.067
She's very satisfied.

00:08:07.067 --> 00:08:08.501
It's for, um...

00:08:08.501 --> 00:08:11.734
It's for a secret Santa thing
at the office.

00:08:11.734 --> 00:08:13.901
Yeah, I look like Seth Meyers.

00:08:13.901 --> 00:08:16.534
I hear that a lot, but I'm not.

00:08:16.534 --> 00:08:17.634
I get that a lot.

00:08:17.634 --> 00:08:21.734
I think a lot of people
look like him.

00:08:21.734 --> 00:08:24.400
And let's not forget this person
is going to have actual power

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.000
in the House GOP majority
next year.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.067
GOP leader Kevin McCarthy
has essentially made a pact

00:08:29.067 --> 00:08:31.167
with Greene and other extremists
to keep them happy

00:08:31.167 --> 00:08:33.701
and let them run wild
in exchange for their votes.

00:08:33.701 --> 00:08:35.734
And part of that pact
means she'll be allowed

00:08:35.734 --> 00:08:37.100
to serve on committees again,

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.067
which she was barred from doing
by Democrats

00:08:39.067 --> 00:08:41.501
after a series of bigoted
and inflammatory remarks.

00:08:41.501 --> 00:08:43.467
-Marjorie Taylor Greene
said she wants a seat

00:08:43.467 --> 00:08:44.567
on the Oversight Committee.

00:08:44.567 --> 00:08:45.734
Are you okay with that?

00:08:45.734 --> 00:08:47.300
Will you support that
despite her history

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:50.634
of inflammatory remarks,
denying the 2020 election?

00:08:50.634 --> 00:08:53.501
-Look, Marjorie Greene, if she's
going to get re-elected,

00:08:53.501 --> 00:08:55.234
she's going to have committees
to serve on.

00:08:55.234 --> 00:08:56.934
Marjorie Greene is going to
have committees, yes.

00:08:56.934 --> 00:08:59.367
She's duly elected
by her district

00:08:59.367 --> 00:09:00.567
and has a right to serve.

00:09:00.567 --> 00:09:01.868
-I'm looking forward

00:09:01.868 --> 00:09:04.868
to Republicans taking back
control in the House.

00:09:04.868 --> 00:09:07.634
And I'm lookin' forward
to serving on committees.

00:09:07.634 --> 00:09:10.767
-It's definitely a red flag
anytime someone says the words

00:09:10.767 --> 00:09:12.534
"I'm looking forward
to serving on committees"

00:09:12.534 --> 00:09:14.734
with that much devious glee.

00:09:14.734 --> 00:09:17.667
She's got the energy
of a PTA president

00:09:17.667 --> 00:09:20.167
who's going to use her power
to blackmail her enemies.

00:09:20.167 --> 00:09:21.400
"That's right, Pam.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.100
I'm back on
the bake sale committee,

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.367
and everyone thinks
your gluten-free brownies

00:09:25.367 --> 00:09:28.300
taste like a..."
-Butt plug or a dildo.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:32.334
-"Hope I didn't ruin
your dessert, Pam."

00:09:32.334 --> 00:09:36.567
Also, what's with the shades,
Officer Cartman?

00:09:36.567 --> 00:09:39.334
She looks like someone
who would try to pull you over

00:09:39.334 --> 00:09:41.000
despite not being a cop.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.367
"Do you know how fast
you were going?"

00:09:42.367 --> 00:09:44.200
"Yeah, like 45 in a 50."

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.567
"Well, I need you
to speed it up.

00:09:45.567 --> 00:09:47.801
I got committee meetings
to get to."

00:09:47.801 --> 00:09:50.868
Somehow, that was not
the most bizarre thing

00:09:50.868 --> 00:09:52.234
Greene said at the gala.

00:09:52.234 --> 00:09:54.801
She also joked that if she
and Trump ally Steve Bannon,

00:09:54.801 --> 00:09:56.167
who was also present
at the event,

00:09:56.167 --> 00:09:58.300
had been in charge
of the attempt

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:00.834
