they would have had weapons.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.701
[ Crowd shouting ]

00:10:44.701 --> 00:10:46.167
You see, the joke is,

00:10:46.167 --> 00:10:48.901
conservatives are such
blood-thirsty psychopaths,

00:10:48.901 --> 00:10:51.300
if they had actually planned
the insurrection on the Capitol,

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.634
it would have been
way more violent.

00:10:52.634 --> 00:10:56.000
That's like if Holiday Inn
ran an ad that said...

00:10:59.801 --> 00:11:02.100
Now, let me just say,
if I saw Greene with a gun,

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:04.200
I would definitely be scared,
but I refuse to believe

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.601
Steve Bannon
knows how to use one.

00:11:05.601 --> 00:11:10.067
No one who layers polo shirts
is good with a firearm.

00:11:10.067 --> 00:11:13.300
In a way, they'd make fun
partners in a buddy-cop movie.

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:14.834
You could call it...
-Butt plug.

00:11:14.834 --> 00:11:16.734
-...and...
-Dildo.

00:11:16.734 --> 00:11:20.400
-"Butt Plug, Dildo,
in my office now!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.634
You two are a real
pain in my ass."

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.567
Voters, including Republicans,
made it clear in November

00:11:30.567 --> 00:11:32.200
that they're tired
of all the MAGA weirdness

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.400
and pro-Trump extremism.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:35.100
If the MAGA movement
